// Title: Suspicious Calculator Usage
// ID: 737e618a-a410-49b5-bec3-9e55ff7fbc15
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2019-02-09
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036
// Description: Detects suspicious use of 'calc.exe' with command line parameters or in a suspicious directory, which is likely caused by some PoC or detection evasion.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.command_line like "*_\\calc.exe *") or ((process.executable endswith "\\calc.exe") and not (((process.executable like "*_:\\Windows\\System32\\*" or process.executable like "*_:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\*" or process.executable like "*_:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\*")))))
